dialogue prologue_stone_wakes
title: The Stone Wakes
trigger: Prologue Waystone
backdrop: greenvalley
speaker commander $commander
speaker cleric cleric
speaker knight knight

node circle commander
  The stone hums awake. A circle of light rolls out over the moor, and the fog lifts off every road it touches.
  -> ease

node ease cleric
  Look up. The Manalith. It eased, just a hair.
  -> more

node more knight
  If one stone does that, there are more of them out there. Only you can see them. Lead the way.
